  skos:changeNote "0.1.0 (2026-10-20): first release. Built by build_domains.py from spec_marketing.py against Baseline Core v1.0 (core 0.1.0)."@en ,
      "0.1.1 (2026-10-20): Domain ontologies and shapes now name the plain ontology IRIs in owl:imports, so the KE Workbench resolves them, and pin the version built against in dcterms:requires. Built by build_domains.py from spec_marketing.py against Baseline Core v1.0 (core 0.1.0)."@en ;
